      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e The change in https://crrev.com/c/6771312 looks like it\u0027s probably fine\n\nYeah. I implemented `hmac_sha256()` using [`BoringSSL HMAC public API`](https://commondatastorage.googleapis.com/chromium-boringssl-docs/hmac.h.html). I used it, to implement extract step of HKDF ([RFC5869 page 3](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5869.html)) and used expand step from [BoringSSL HKDF public API](https://commondatastorage.googleapis.com/chromium-boringssl-docs/hkdf.h.html).",
